('T06 / I','Private proof через public graph; 3×5','Published searchable source resume; evidence controls; live cert scope','test_evidence_http.py: private certificate не раскрыт'),
('T07 / T','Повышение грейда редактированием; 4×4','Immutable role/grade certificate; 90-day guard; scoped ledger','test_resume_qualification.py: edit/new resume/cooldown'),
